        "body": "**FPP Version and Hardware**: \r\nFPP v8.2 running on K8-B\r\n\r\n\r\n**Describe the bug and Steps to reproduce**: \r\nA clear and concise description of what the bug is and the steps to be taken to reproduce. \r\n1. Run controller in remote mode\r\n2. ???\r\n3. Controller has all lights dark while rest of show is playing; web UI reports fppd not running.\r\n(this has happened three times during our halloween show)\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**: \r\nfppd shouldn't hang\r\n\r\n**Additional context**: \r\nfppd doesn't produce a crash. I was able to ssh in, attach gdb and get a list of all thread backtraces, then kill fppd and it automatically restarted.\r\n\r\n**Additional Attachments**\r\n[FPP_Logs_20241030.2257.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17579895/FPP_Logs_20241030.2257.zip)\r\n[fpp-callstacks.txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17579896/fpp-callstacks.txt)\r\n\r\n",
