        },
        "body": "Do you have an example of a situation where having the index is actually useful when you can get and set personas directly with this?\n\nThe only other way to work with personas is with mn.Personas which also returns a persona object that can be used to set here.\n\nAnd both here and there refer to the current mission personas.\n\nCause now you're asking me to partially undo what you just asked me to do...",
