        "body": "Adds a lua func to get a ship's persona as a persona handle. Pretty straightfoward.\r\n\r\nThere is already a virtvar to get a ship's persona index which can used to iterate through the mission's personas but this is faster and simpler. I thought about deprecating the virtvar but if anyone is using it to set a ship's persona then I'd have to add a setShipPersona() func and we're back to having two functions again.\r\n\r\nI also considered having the virtvar optionally return the persona directly but it's specifically called PersonaIndex which I felt confused the matter a bit.\r\n\r\nOpen to opinions if there's a better way to organize this.",
