        "body": "[//]: # (REMBEMBER! Add links to things related to the bug using for example:)\r\n[//]: # (https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk)\r\n\r\n\r\n**Description:**\r\n\r\nWhile alliance shamans can pick the initial quest, It seems only Draenei can continue the chain. there's no follow up quest for Dwarves.\r\nOnly on wowhead being Draenei is mentioned as a condition but seems odd as all shamans on horde side have access to this chain.\r\n\r\n**How to reproduce:**\r\n\r\nCreate a dwarf shaman and pick up the intial quest (9500) then continue the chain.\r\n\r\n**Database links:**\r\n\r\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9500/call-of-water (start of chain quest)\r\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9501/call-of-water\r\nhttps://wowwiki-archive.fandom.com/wiki/Quest:Call_of_Water_(Exodar,_2)\r\nhttps://wowpedia.fandom.com/wiki/Call_of_Water_(Exodar)\r\nhttps://wowpedia.fandom.com/wiki/Call_of_Water_(Exodar,_2)",
